# Internal files that must never be served from the website.
# Without this, Vercel published the whole repo: anyone could download the
# database schema, migrations, seed data, supplier spreadsheets, internal
# docs and admin tooling (e.g. /supabase/schema.sql, /supabase/Catalog.xlsx).
# Note: "supabase/" is the folder only -- the site's /supabase.js stays.
supabase/
docs/
tools/
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/
products.csv
*.md
*.sql
*.xlsx
*.mjs
